<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Health & Wellness - FitLife</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav>
        <div class="container">
            <h1>FitLife</h1>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="/videos">Videos</a></li>
                <li><a href="/nutrition">Nutrition</a></li>
                <li><a href="/health">Health</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Fitness and Nutrition for Better Health</h1>
            <p>
                Discover how consistent exercise and balanced eating work together to improve your energy, mood, and long-term wellness.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <h2>Why Fitness Matters</h2>
        <div class="card-grid">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Stronger Heart</h3>
                <p>Regular exercise helps lower blood pressure, improve circulation, and reduce the risk of heart disease.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Weight Management</h3>
                <p>Physical activity helps burn calories and maintain a healthy body composition over time.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Mental Wellbeing</h3>
                <p>Movement boosts mood, reduces stress, and supports better sleep through natural endorphins.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <h2>Why Nutrition Matters</h2>
        <div class="card-grid">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Balanced Energy</h3>
                <p>Eating the right foods keeps your energy steady and fuels your workouts and daily activities.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Stronger Immunity</h3>
                <p>Vitamins, minerals, and whole foods help your body repair itself and defend against illness.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Recovery Support</h3>
                <p>Protein, healthy fats, and hydration support muscle recovery and reduce soreness after exercise.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <h2>Fitness + Nutrition = Health</h2>
        <div class="card-grid">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Better Performance</h3>
                <p>Combining strong workouts with smart nutrition gives you more energy and better results.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Everyday Vitality</h3>
                <p>Healthy habits help you feel more focused, confident, and ready for the day.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Long-Term Wellness</h3>
                <p>A consistent fitness and nutrition routine lowers your risk of chronic disease and supports a longer, healthier life.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</body>
</html>
